{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"408","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Line to Cashier"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Little Vasya went to the supermarket to get some groceries. He walked about the supermarket for a long time and got a basket full of products. Now he needs to choose the cashier to pay for the products."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There are "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" cashiers at the exit from the supermarket. At the moment the queue for the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th cashier already has "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ki"},{"kind":"text","text":" people. The "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th person standing in the queue to the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th cashier has "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"mi, j"},{"kind":"text","text":" items in the basket. Vasya knows that:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" the cashier needs 5 seconds to scan one item; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" after the cashier scans each item of some customer, he needs 15 seconds to take the customer's money and give him the change. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Of course, Vasya wants to select a queue so that he can leave the supermarket as soon as possible. Help him write a program that displays the minimum number of seconds after which Vasya can get to one of the cashiers."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 100"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the number of cashes in the shop. The second line contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" space-separated integers: "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k1, k2, ..., kn"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ ki ≤ 100"},{"kind":"text","text":"), where "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ki"},{"kind":"text","text":" is the number of people in the queue to the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th cashier."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th of the next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ki"},{"kind":"text","text":" space-separated integers: "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"mi, 1, mi, 2, ..., mi, ki"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ mi, j ≤ 100"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the number of products the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th person in the queue for the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th cash has."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print a single integer — the minimum number of seconds Vasya needs to get to the cashier."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1\n1\n1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"20\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4\n1 4 3 2\n100\n1 2 2 3\n1 9 1\n7 8\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"100\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second test sample, if Vasya goes to the first queue, he gets to the cashier in "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"100·5 + 15 = 515"},{"kind":"text","text":" seconds. But if he chooses the second queue, he will need "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1·5 + 2·5 + 2·5 + 3·5 + 4·15 = 100"},{"kind":"text","text":" seconds. He will need "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1·5 + 9·5 + 1·5 + 3·15 = 100"},{"kind":"text","text":" seconds for the third one and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"7·5 + 8·5 + 2·15 = 105"},{"kind":"text","text":" seconds for the fourth one. Thus, Vasya gets to the cashier quicker if he chooses the second or the third queue."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"408A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/408/problem/A"}